# Keep LF line endings in every checkout so SQL snapshots, generated TypeScript
# and the embedded migration string are byte-identical on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.gif  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.exe  binary
*.msi  binary
*.node binary
